  "limitations": [
    "Node tracing perturbs timing and amplifies stream-synchronization effects. Observed intergraph gaps are not normal-inference CPU overhead.",
    "A graph gap includes sampling, allocation, encoding and CPU gaps; CPU API waits include GPU execution and must not be added to kernel duration.",
